and reuses established patterns \\u2014 no new components, just explicit focus styling on existing semantic HTML controls.\"}, {\"type\": \"text\", \"text\": \"agentId: a64161b0f59a7349a (use SendMessage with to: 'a64161b0f59a7349a', summary: '<5-10 word recap>' to continue this agent)\\n<usage>subagent_tokens: 37325\\ntool_uses: 6\\nduration_ms: 183948</usage>\"}]", "meta": {"native_type": "user", "tool_use_id": "toolu_013vvA1M4oH8aNeu43t46pJE", "session_id": "dc5f8c4c-3ccf-4cb5-b01c-d37b1d5c560b"}}
